      "id": "claim_b930396cfdab4aeaa56cb30791455f5a",
      "statement": "PATH resolution exists because a process launched from Finder, Dock or launchd inherits only /usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin, which made a fully equipped developer machine report every capability as missing.",
